{"speciesId":251,"names":{"fr":"Celebi","es":"Celebi","en":"Celebi","ja":"セレビィ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"This POKéMON wan­ ders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When CELEBI disap­ pears deep in a forest, it is said to leave behind an egg it brought from the future."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Revered as a guardian of the forest, CELEBI appears wherever beautiful forests exist."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When CELEBI disappears deep in a forest, it is said to leave behind an egg it brought from the future."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This POKéMON wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This Pokémon wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When CELEBI disappears deep in a forest, it is said to leave behind an egg it brought from the future."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a le pouvoir de voyager dans le temps. Cependant, on dit qu’il n’apparaît qu’en temps de paix."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a le pouvoir de voyager dans le temps. Cependant, on dit qu’il n’apparaît qu’en temps de paix."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon voyage dans le temps. Les forêts où il apparaît deviennent prodigieusement luxuriantes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este Pokémon vaga por el tiempo. La hierba y los árboles crecen por los campos por donde pasa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This Pokémon wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"時間を超えて あちこち さまよう。 セレビィが 姿を 現した 森は 草木が 生い茂るという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a le pouvoir de voyager dans le temps. Cependant, on dit qu’il n’apparaît qu’en temps de paix."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Puede viajar en el tiempo, pero se dice que solo aparece en tiempos de paz."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"時間を 越える 力を 使う。 平和な 時代にだけ 姿を 見せると 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon est venu du futur en voyageant dans le temps. On raconte que quand Celebi apparaît, cela signifie que le futur sera bon et agréable."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon vino del futuro haciendo un viaje en el tiempo. Hay quien piensa que, mientras Celebi siga apareciendo, hay un futuro brillante y esperanzador."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as Celebi appears, a bright and shining future awaits us."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"時を 越え 未来から やってきた ポケモン。 セレビィが 姿を 現す 限り 明るい 未来が 待っていると 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon est venu du futur en voyageant dans le temps. On raconte que quand Celebi apparaît, cela signifie que le futur sera bon et agréable."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Este Pokémon vino del futuro haciendo un viaje en el tiempo. Hay quien piensa que, mientras Celebi siga apareciendo, hay un futuro brillante y esperanzador."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as Celebi appears, a bright and shining future awaits us."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"時を 越え 未来から やってきた ポケモン。 セレビィが 姿を 現す 限り 明るい 未来が 待っていると 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il possède le pouvoir de voyager dans le temps. Il a été considéré comme une divinité sylvestre à différentes époques."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es capaz de viajar en el tiempo. Su condición de guardián del bosque ha quedado constatada en documentos conservados de diversas épocas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon has the ability to move through time. Records describing it as a forest deity can be found from many different eras."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"時を 超える 力を もつ。 森の 神様として さまざまな 時代に 記録が 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon venu du f